{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 19, "data": [{"docid2": 1773006, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202204/t20220401_1773006.htm", "content": "\n　　3月31日，我市召开习近平总书记来明考察亲历者座谈会，通过8位亲历者的交流分享，再重温、再学习、再领会习近平总书记重要嘱托，凝聚感恩奋进的强大精神动力。\n　　会上，去年3月23日习近平总书记来明考察时的现", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202204/t20220401_1773006.htm", "docreltime": "2022.04.01 10:25:00", "doctitle": "我市召开习近平总书记来明考察亲历者座谈会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1901050, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202204/t20220401_1773006.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202204/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1728367, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202111/t20211118_1728367.htm", "content": "\n　　11月17日，全市医改再出发暨卫生健康大会召开，深入贯彻习近平总书记来闽、来明考察重要讲话重要指示精神，按照孙春兰副总理来明调研指示要求和省委、省政府工作部署，坚定不移高举医改旗帜，全力推进医改再出发", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202111/t20211118_1728367.htm", "docreltime": "2021.11.18 08:49:00", "doctitle": "全市医改再出发暨卫生健康大会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1842217, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202111/t20211118_1728367.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202111/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1712133, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202110/t20211001_1712133.htm", "content": "\n　　9月30日，市委书记余红胜主持召开十届市委常委会第一次会议，重温习近平总书记12次来明考察重要讲话重要指示精神，学习贯彻《中国共产党地方委员会工作条例》，研究加强市委常委班子自身建设。\n　　会议指出，学", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202110/t20211001_1712133.htm", "docreltime": "2021.10.01 12:04:00", "doctitle": "市委常委会召开第一次会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1822644, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202110/t20211001_1712133.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202110/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1701997, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202109/t20210903_1701997.htm", "content": "\n　　为深入贯彻落实习近平总书记来闽、来明考察重要讲话精神，按照省委、省政府“千方百计大招商招大商”工作部署，推动我市大招商实现大突破、招好商取得好成效，近日，三明市制定出台“1+11+N”系列文件（“1”是", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202109/t20210903_1701997.htm", "docreltime": "2021.09.03 11:43:00", "doctitle": "三明市制定出台“1+11+N”系列文件进一步健全完善招商引资政策措施", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1812001, "sourcename": "三明市商务局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202109/t20210903_1701997.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202109/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1647606, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202103/t20210328_1647606.htm", "content": "\n　　浓浓深情暖心田，殷殷嘱托催人进。3月22日至25日，习近平总书记在福建考察并作重要讲话，在当地干部群众中引发热烈反响。大家表示，一定牢记习近平总书记嘱托，落实党中央决策部署，坚持稳中求进工作总基调，立", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202103/t20210328_1647606.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.28 15:36:00", "doctitle": "习近平总书记福建考察重要讲话引发热烈反响", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1747638, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202103/t20210328_1647606.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1647215, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202103/t20210326_1647215.htm", "content": "\n　　3月25日晚，央视《新闻联播》头条报道了习近平总书记到福建考察调研时的情况，全方位展现了总书记对福建、对三明工作的高度重视和对人民群众的亲切关怀。\n　　在沙县总医院、夏茂镇俞邦村、沙县农村产权交易中心", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202103/t20210326_1647215.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.26 09:00:00", "doctitle": "习近平总书记来闽考察调研引起广大干部群众热烈反响", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1747005, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202103/t20210326_1647215.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1647062, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647062.htm", "content": "\n　　习近平：健康是幸福生活最重要的指标\n　　3月23日上午，正在福建考察调研的习近平总书记，来到三明市沙县总医院实地了解医改惠民情况。他指出，健康是幸福生活最重要的指标，健康是1，其他是后面的0，没有1，再", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647062.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.25 15:08:00", "doctitle": "习近平：做到大病不出省，一般病在市县解决，日常疾病在基层解决", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746563, "sourcename": "人民日报客户端", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647062.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1647021, 