1:19:00", "doctitle": "跟着总书记的考察足迹丨100秒，带你走进三明", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746514, "sourcename": "新华社", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647016.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1647015, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647015.htm", "content": "\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647015.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.25 11:14:00", "doctitle": "图集｜习近平在福建三明考察", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746513, "sourcename": "新华社", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647015.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1647012, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647012.htm", "content": "", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647012.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.25 11:11:00", "doctitle": "跟着总书记打卡沙县小吃第一村", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746510, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647012.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1647010, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647010.htm", "content": "\n　　跟随总书记的脚步 体会足迹中的深意\n　　“三明医改”引领全国\n　　改的是什么？\n　　▲三明市沙县医院\n　　“沙县小吃第一村”有三看\n　　具体看什么？\n　　▲“沙县小吃第一村”——三明市沙县俞邦村\n　　新时", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647010.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.25 11:07:00", "doctitle": "时政马上评丨跟随总书记的脚步 走进三明揭秘“三明答卷”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746508, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647010.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1647008, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647008.htm", "content": "\n　　3月23日，正在福建考察的习近平来到沙县农村产权交易中心，了解当地深化林权制度改革情况。\n　　2015年7月，沙县农村产权交易中心成立，主要为群众办理农村产权交易和抵押贷款服务。\n　　沙县林业服务中心就在产", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647008.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.25 11:02:00", "doctitle": "习近平福建行丨走进沙县农村产权交易中心看“林改”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746505, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1647008.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1646984, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646984.htm", "content": "\n　　医改，公认的世界性难题。然而有一个地方的医改却得到了习近平的肯定。这就是“三明医改”。2019年7月24日，习近平总书记在中央全面深化改革委员会第九次会议上，强调要总结推广三明医改经验。 \n　　3月23日，正", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646984.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.25 10:40:00", "doctitle": "独家视频丨“三明医改”为什么能得到总书记的肯定", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746480, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646984.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1646968, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646968.htm", "content": "\n　　福建省三明市沙县，“国民美食”沙县小吃的发源地。3月23日，习近平总书记来到夏茂镇俞邦村，了解当地推进乡村振兴等情况。\n　　俞邦村，有“沙县小吃第一村”之称。当绿水青山与人间百味相遇，沙县小吃筑起大产", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646968.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.25 10:25:00", "doctitle": "习近平福建行丨百味沙县 魅力俞邦——走进沙县小吃第一村", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746461, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646968.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1646957, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646957.htm", "content": "\n　　3月23日上午，正在福建考察的习近平来到三明市沙县总医院，了解当地开展医药卫生体制改革情况。\n　　沙县总医院，2017年6月由原沙县医院和沙县中医医院联合组建，下辖12个基层分院，延伸村卫生所128个。\n　　它", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646957.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.24 10:14:00", "doctitle": "习近平福建行丨走进沙县总医院看“医改”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746450, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646957.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1646954, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646954.htm", "content": "\n　　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646954.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.24 10:11:00", "doctitle": "独家视频丨习近平在三明沙县考察调研", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746447, "sourcename": "央视新闻", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646954.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1646913, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "习近平总书记在三明（已归档）", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646913.htm", "content": "\n　　23日，正在福建省考察调研的习近平总书记，先后来到三明市沙县总医院、夏茂镇俞邦村、沙县农村产权交易中心，了解当地开展医药卫生体制改革、推进乡村振兴、深化林权制度改革等情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646913.htm", "docreltime": "2021.03.24 09:32:00", "doctitle": "习近平在三明沙县考察调研", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1746401, "sourcename": "人民日报客户端、央视新闻客户端", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/t20210325_1646913.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/xjpzsm/202103/", "rels": []}]}